; Booked postings. A posting's activity is its booked units: an implicit posting gets what booking makes of the
; others, here the cost of shares sold from two lots; several postings of one transaction to a budget's accounts each
; count, and each is listed.
option "operating_currency" "USD"
option "timezone" "UTC"

1970-01-01 commodity USD
1970-01-01 commodity AAPL

2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank
2024-01-01 open Assets:Broker
  booking_method: "FIFO"
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Gifts
  budget: Gifts
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Fees
  budget: Gifts

2024-01-01 budget Gifts USD
2024-01-01 budget-add Gifts 2000 USD

2024-01-02 * "Broker" "buy"
  Assets:Broker 5 AAPL {100 USD}
  Assets:Bank -500 USD

2024-01-03 * "Broker" "buy again"
  Assets:Broker 5 AAPL {120 USD}
  Assets:Bank -600 USD

2024-02-01 * "Friend" "shares from two lots given away, the expense implicit"
  Assets:Broker -8 AAPL {}
  Expenses:Gifts

2024-02-02 * "Shop" "three postings to the budget's accounts in one transaction"
  Expenses:Gifts 10 USD
  Expenses:Fees 2 USD
  Expenses:Gifts 3 USD
  Assets:Bank
